          <description align="left" color="orange" colored="true" height="145" resized="true" width="282" x="10" y="166">Use BIC optimization to find appropriate #clusters, or set #components for #clusters&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Outlier score&lt;br&gt;- Likehood (should be low)&lt;br&gt;- Inverted likelihood (should be high)&lt;br&gt;- Negative log-likelihood (should be high)&lt;br&gt;</description>
        </process>
